# The team works from one shared GitHub account (@izyteam2025), not individual
# logins, so GitHub cannot enforce "code owner review" here: it blocks a PR's
# author from approving their own PR, and every PR here is opened as
# @izyteam2025 too, which would deadlock every merge. This file is documentation
# of who is responsible for these paths, not a GitHub-enforced gate — see
# docs/github-governance.md. Templates, the gate, URLs and site-wide facts
# need Artem's review before merging, done as a manual step, not a GitHub check.
/src/                     @izyteam2025
/scripts/                 @izyteam2025
/.github/                 @izyteam2025
/content/site.json        @izyteam2025
/content/services.json    @izyteam2025
/content/locations.json   @izyteam2025
/content/brands.json      @izyteam2025
/content/redirects.json   @izyteam2025
/content/keywords.json    @izyteam2025
